category: Science
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libgomp1 libstdc++6 python3 zlib0
sdesc: "Ultra-fast and memory-efficient (meta-)genome assembler"
ldesc: "MEGAHIT is an ultra-fast and memory-efficient NGS assembler. It is optimized
for metagenomes, but also works well on generic single genome assembly (small
or mammalian size) and single-cell assembly."

